    [
     1,
     "Hello all,\r<br>I&#39;m analyzing data from line-transect census in Distance 5.0. Now I&#39;m\r<br>analyzing 1045 observations on Cebus apella and I&#39;ve got a warning =\r<br>message\r<br>saying that only 500 out of a total of 1045 observations will be shown =\r<br>on\r<br>the qq-plot.=20\r<br>Yesterday I was analyzing the same data set in another computer with\r<br>Distance 4.0 and we&#39;ve got no warning messages about that.\r<br>=20\r<br>Is it a default from version 5.0? Is there a way to change it and make =\r<br>the\r<br>qq-plot with all observations?=20\r<br>=20\r<br>Many thanks,\r<br>Fernanda=20\r<br>=20\r<br>-------------------------------------------------------------------------=\r<br>---\r<br>-------\r<br>Fernanda Michalski, PhD Student\r<br>University of East Anglia\r<br>School of Environmental Sciences\r<br>Norwich, NR4 7TJ, England, UK\r<br><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">f.mic...@uea.ac.uk</a>\r<br>=20\r<br>Instituto Pro-Carnivoros <a href=\"http://www.procarnivoros.org.br\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.procarnivoros.org.br&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479300014000&amp;usg=AOvVaw21Nmbj89Zr8cH1uQWGP82Y\">http://www.procarnivoros.org.br</a>\r<br>&lt;<a href=\"http://www.procarnivoros.org.br/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.procarnivoros.org.br/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479300014000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3L7pQR86F0UOiTNxEhJEdl\">http://www.procarnivoros.org.br/</a>&gt;=20\r<br>=20\r<br>&#39;Our mission is to promote the conservation of Neotropical carnivores =\r<br>and\r<br>their habitats.&#39;=20\r<br>=20\r<br>\r<br>--\r<br>distance-sampling list home page:\r<br>  <a href=\"http://www.jiscmail.ac.uk/lists/distance-sampling.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.jiscmail.ac.uk/lists/distance-sampling.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479300014000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3RIry9gQrDXVnnGlVaVwZu\">http://www.jiscmail.ac.uk/lists/distance-sampling.html</a>\r<br>To unsubscribe, go to the home page and click &quot;Join or leave the list&quot;,\r<br>  or email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jisc...@jiscmail.ac.uk</a> with the following message body:\r<br>  leave distance-sampling\r<br>Before posting to the list, read the list guidelines at\r<br>  <a href=\"http://www.jiscmail.ac.uk/files/distance-sampling/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.jiscmail.ac.uk/files/distance-sampling/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479300014000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1KXrBVICGipr5poqXx7JCo\">http://www.jiscmail.ac.uk/files/distance-sampling/</a>\r<br>    distance-sampling.welcome\r<br>Any questions, email the list owner at\r<br>  <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">distance-sam...@jiscmail.ac.uk</a>\r<br>--\r<br>"
    ]
