   "subject": "Re: QQ- Plots in Distance Analysis",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hi=20Fernanda,=20list,\r<br>\r<br>RTFM!=20=20Open=20the=20online=20help,=20select=20the=20search=20tab=20and=\r<br>=20type=20&quot;qq-plot&quot;.=20=20One=20\r<br>of=20the=20pages=20suggested=20is=20for=20the=20Model=20Definition=20prope=\r<br>rties:=20&quot;Diagnostics=20\r<br>-=20Detection=20Function=20Tab=20-=20CDS=20and=20MCDS&quot;.=20=20On=20this=20p=\r<br>age,=20it=20says:\r<br>\r<br>--\r<br>\r<br>K-S=20test=20goodness-of-fit=20test=20and=20qq=20plots\r<br>------------------------------------------\r<br>\r<br>Note!=20This=20option=20is=20only=20relevant=20if=20you=20are=20analyzing=20=\r<br>the=20data=20as=20exact=20\r<br>distances.\r<br>\r<br>Qq=20plots=20are=20a=20graphical=20technique=20for=20assessing=20the=20ade=\r<br>quacy=20of=20the=20fit,=20\r<br>and=20the=20associated=20test=20statistics=20(Kolmogorov-Smirnov=20and=20C=\r<br>ram=82r-von=20Mises)=20\r<br>test=20goodness-of-fit=20for=20exact=20data.=20=20For=20more=20about=20the=\r<br>se=20outputs,=20see=20\r<br>Chapter=208=20-=20Conventional=20Distance=20Sampling=20Analysis.\r<br>\r<br>Since=20these=20outputs=20can=20take=20a=20while=20to=20generate=20for=20l=\r<br>arge=20datasets,=20there=20\r<br>is=20an=20option=20here=20to=20turn=20them=20off.=20=20Qq=20plots=20have=20=\r<br>one=20plotted=20point=20per=20\r<br>observation,=20so=20for=20large=20datasets=20it=20is=20better=20to=20plot=20=\r<br>only=20a=20subset=20of=20\r<br>points.=20=20By=20default,=20the=20maximum=20number=20of=20points=20to=20p=\r<br>lot=20is=20500,=20but=20that=20\r<br>can=20be=20changed=20here.=20=20Entering=200=20under=20Maximum=20num=20poi=\r<br>nts=20in=20qq=20plots=20means=20\r<br>that=20all=20points=20are=20plotted,=20regardless=20of=20how=20many=20ther=\r<br>e=20are.\r<br>\r<br>--\r<br>\r<br>I&#39;ll=20add=20some=20extra=20pointers=20to=20this=20page=20so=20it&#39;s=20easi=\r<br>er=20to=20find=20from=20the=20\r<br>other=20help=20pages=20on=20qq-plots.\r<br>\r<br>=20-=20Len\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>--\r<br>Len=20Thomas,=20Co-ordinator,=20Distance=20Development=20Project\r<br>Research=20Unit=20for=20Wildlife=20Population=20Assessment\r<br>Centre=20for=20Research=20into=20Environmental=20and=20Ecological=20Modell=\r<br>ing\r<br>The=20Observatory,=20University=20of=20St=20Andrews,=20Scotland=20KY16=209=\r<br>LZ\r<br>\r<br>=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20email:=<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">20dis...@mcs.st-and.ac.uk</a>\r<br>Distance=20home=20page:=20<a href=\"http://www.ruwpa.st-and.ac.uk/distance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.ruwpa.st-and.ac.uk/distance/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792479300016000&amp;usg=AOvVaw15V63ygEoVi-LxJdqXI5o5\">http://www.ruwpa.st-and.ac.uk/distance/</a>\r<br>"
